# Doc Pawi build-time configuration (copy to .env.local and adjust). No secrets are required:
# the app has no accounts, no API keys, and no backend.
# EXPO_PUBLIC_* values are embedded in the app bundle, so never put secrets here.

# Windows only (set in the shell that runs Gradle, not in this file):
#   DOC_PAWI_CXX_JOBS=2                    parallel C++ compile jobs for the native build
#   DOC_PAWI_CXX_ROOT=D:\DocPawiBuildCache\cxx   short CMake staging folder (e.g. on a roomier drive)
